{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## `make verify` run 2 — rc=2, single failure, attributed to pre-existing bug `ab03-0276-374b-46af`\n\nRun: `.rebar/scratch/verify-c670-v2/`, worktree `impl-c670` at `938e962c5d8`, `PYTEST_WORKERS=4`.\n\n```\nFAILED tests/unit/test_store_commit_maintenance_bd66.py::test_the_trace_check_detects_maintenance_inside_a_commit\n1 failed, 20140 passed, 27 skipped, 48 warnings in 4265.25s (1:11:05)\n```\n\n### The failure is outside this story's diff\n\n`git diff --name-only origin/main...HEAD` returns 10 paths:\n\n```\n.pre-commit-config.yaml\ndocs/adr/.numbers/0122\ndocs/adr/0122-similar-ticket-retrieval.md\ndocs/adr/README.md\nevals/similar-tickets/.gitignore\nevals/similar-tickets/README.md\nevals/similar-tickets/benchmark.json\nevals/similar-tickets/digests.json\nevals/similar-tickets/measure.py\ntests/unit/test_transition_force_flag_24f7.py\n```\n\nNone is under `src/rebar/_store/`, which is the code the failing test exercises.\n\n### It is a load-sensitive timeout, not an assertion\n\nThe failure is a `RebarError` raised inside `_create_two_tickets_traced` at\n`test_store_commit_maintenance_bd66.py:186`:\n\n```\nrebar._errors.RebarError: rebar create failed (exit 1):\n  Error: git commit failed while holding lock: git timed out after 30s\n```\n\nThe test deliberately removes the suppression that keeps production from paying repack cost inside\na commit (`monkeypatch.setattr(event_commit_git, \"_AUTOMAINT_OFF\", ())`) after\n`_cross_the_maintenance_threshold` guarantees a repack will fire, then runs that repack inside a\ncommit bounded at `_GIT_TIMEOUT = 30` (`event_commit_git.py:38`).\n\nIsolated on this same tree: **`1 passed in 31.38s`**. At 31s solo against a 30s bound the margin is\nunder a second. Three other `make verify` runs were in flight on this host during run 2\n(`impl-25a4`, `impl-f5f5`, `impl-8257`); 1-minute load average 36.\n\nThis is the third occurrence and the second of this exact timeout mode; both reproductions and the\nfinding that Gerrit 3135's diagnosis message cannot fire on the timeout path are filed on\n`ab03-0276-374b-46af`.\n\n### Next action for this story\n\nRe-verify queued to run with **no other verify in flight on the host**\n(`.rebar/scratch/await_solo_then_c670.sh` → `verify-c670-v3`), which removes the contention rather\nthan retrying into it. No change to this story's tree.\n"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793517975258977244,"uuid":"c3b7f9e5-aa4b-4525-ae7a-7ff1079a6d1b"}